<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs firm/up $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs firm/up $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were firm to mostly $0.50 Higher. Demand was moderate on a moderate movement. Top $53.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  52.00-53.50 Few 51.50</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  46.00-51.50</p>
<p>		210-230 lbs.  41.00-46.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/up $1.00. Top $53.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs. 42.00-45.00 Few 41.00</p>
<p>		450-500 lbs. 44.00-47.00</p>
<p>		500-650 lbs. 48.00-52.50 Few 53.00</p>
</text>
